                                                "example_id": "0ddea007-f7a4-48b3-8fc8-61329d3bd605",
                                                "sense_id": "40f2d8dd-1738-3b47-9e0a-161c230739e8",
                                                "text": "Holonyms: watercraft, vessel, vessel"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "63e4ba40-81f8-4ea7-8cf9-581a823b0b93",
                                                "sense_id": "40f2d8dd-1738-3b47-9e0a-161c230739e8",
                                                "text": "On a recent Saturday during the confusion of this watery city’s annual Gay Pride Parade along the majestic Princes Canal, a beach umbrella was knocked into the water from the foredeck of Jackie Wijnakker’s houseboat, so she dove into the water to fetch it, unsuccessfully."
